{"bangumi":{"date":"2008-04-03","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e8/f2/2896_Lhk5E.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e8/f2/2896_Lhk5E.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e8/f2/2896_Lhk5E.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e8/f2/2896_Lhk5E.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e8/f2/2896_Lhk5E.jpg"},"summary":"高中生，四月一日君寻在偶然的机缘下闯入闻名异世界的次元魔女，侑子的魔法商店。四月一日在此许下要剔除自身灵能力的愿望 ，因此变成魔法商店的长期工读生，而围绕在他身边的同学小葵、百目鬼也同样是特殊能力者。在这之后，分散在其它异世界国家的小樱，小狼，黑钢与法伊皆因飞王的阴谋皆来到魔法商店。因而使得黑色摩可拿觉醒留在愿望商店陪在侑子身边。这是一个关于穿梭异世界和不可思议现象的魔法故事。","name":"×××HOLiC◆継","name_cn":"×××HOLiC◆继","tags":[{"name":"CLAMP","count":969,"total_count":17910},{"name":"XXXholic","count":741,"total_count":3411},{"name":"奇幻","count":393,"total_count":472742},{"name":"TV","count":353,"total_count":1406560},{"name":"四月一日","count":314,"total_count":901},{"name":"福山潤","count":276,"total_count":5218},{"name":"Production.I.G","count":259,"total_count":42363},{"name":"2008年4月","count":244,"total_count":4342},{"name":"2008","count":230,"total_count":35722},{"name":"漫画改","count":186,"total_count":864065},{"name":"中井和哉","count":136,"total_count":1727},{"name":"羁绊","count":126,"total_count":359},{"name":"ProductionIG","count":113,"total_count":838},{"name":"水岛努","count":67,"total_count":19475},{"name":"漫改","count":65,"total_count":361793},{"name":"ProductionI.G","count":54,"total_count":35156},{"name":"百四","count":54,"total_count":199},{"name":"S.E.N.S","count":44,"total_count":141},{"name":"灵异","count":38,"total_count":4212},{"name":"日本","count":34,"total_count":298353},{"name":"穿越","count":32,"total_count":63134},{"name":"神思者","count":29,"total_count":33},{"name":"福山润","count":29,"total_count":15104},{"name":"水島努","count":20,"total_count":3561},{"name":"横手美智子","count":17,"total_count":4685},{"name":"治愈","count":14,"total_count":302254},{"name":"2008年","count":12,"total_count":1947},{"name":"续作","count":11,"total_count":46503},{"name":"日常","coun